      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that just feels like settling. like i'm just supposed to accept a life of being background noise. if i’m not pushing boundaries or making an impact, i’m just taking up space. is there really any dignity in just being another person who was \"competent\" but ultimately unremarkable? it feels like a slow death to just exist like that.",
